        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "This week’s Modern schedule included a 301-player Super RCQ, which was won by Jeskai Energy: deck:af10094d2257be87dcfd. The other three qualifications went to Hollowvine, Necrodominance, and Prowess. The Top 8 also featured eight different decks, underscoring just how open Modern currently is. Since the last ban announcement, Esper Goryo's briefly rose above 10% share in a few previous weeks, but no archetype has managed to average 10% across a four-week window.",
          "zh": "本周摩登有一场超级RCQ，301人参加，最终由洁斯凯能量席卷：deck:af10094d2257be87dcfd。另外三个资格由藤蔓石椁、黑绿死冥、红蓝灵技拿到。八强也是八套牌，充分体现了现在摩登的混战局面。自从上次禁牌之后，有几周艾斯波怨灵短暂超过10%占比，但按四周区间平均，没有一套牌能做到这一点。"
        }
